WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:04.991
Opal Meetings runs the one to one meetings of every executive event.

2
00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:14.515
The Opal seal comes down to the first step: registration. Every delegate and every vendor confirms their invitation and gets their badge.

3
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:20.653
Then each side picks who they want to meet, and ranks them. A pick both sides make counts most.

4
00:00:20.956 --> 00:00:26.046
The algorithm pairs them, and books each pair into a time slot both of them have free.

5
00:00:26.665 --> 00:00:32.638
And every meeting reaches its table: one to one, two to one, or in a group.

6
00:00:32.939 --> 00:00:38.865
The seal on the table becomes the phone: each attendee's portal, with their schedule live.

7
00:00:39.947 --> 00:00:44.805
The phone grows into the tablet: the team's operations dashboard.

8
00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:49.557
Quotas, compatibility and alerts, in real time and in one view.

9
00:00:50.122 --> 00:00:53.726
And the tablet becomes the event badge, on its lanyard.

10
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.759
Opal Meetings. By Opal Group.
